        "TileImage": "$($repository 7d28ed81-2b13-4a8f-8276-0216c5e8058d).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. Your targets are Zana &quot;The Vulture&quot; Kazemi, Trina Royce and Muayid Sofran, all current or past Crystal Dawn operatives.They are participating in the opening of the Sceptre, the tallest building in the world in Dubai. Sources tell us they are running a secret operation under the codename &quot;Falcon&quot;. Whatever their plan is, we must put an end to it, and an end to Crystal Dawn altogether. We haven&apos;t got much time, do it as fast as possible. Good luck, 47.",
